      "anonymous": false,
      "kind": "telegram",
      "text": "🙏PRAYER DOG🙏 3 prayers from around the world",
      "ts": "2026-08-13T01:16:52Z"
    },
    {
      "chatId": -1003502632009,
      "messageId": 5249,
      "userId": 8045440327,
      "displayName": "✝️🙏PRAYER DOG🐺🥀 I am L.A.W.",
      "anonymous": false,
      "kind": "telegram",
      "text": "I don't know about the website but here's a prayer for them 👍",
      "ts": "2026-08-13T01:32:19Z"
    },
    {
      "chatId": -1003502632009,
      "messageId": 5250,
      "userId": 8045440327,
      "displayName": "✝️🙏PRAYER DOG🐺🥀 I am L.A.W.",
      "anonymous": false,
      "kind": "telegram",
      "text": "Additionally sent more people your way, including the couple, so you might have people show up at your group, I am sharing the QR code",
      "ts": "2026-08-13T01:33:06Z"
    },
    {
      "chatId": -1003502632009,
      "messageId": 5256,
      "userId": 5309134293,
      "displayName": "David",
      "anonymous": false,
      "kind": "telegram",
      "text": "Going around Everett inviting people to young adults and informing them of the back to school bash this Saturday. I just had a simple prayer that Jesus shows me where I need to go and who needs to hear about this and stepped out in faith. First one today, so pray for me too!",
      "ts": "2026-08-13T19:45:58Z"
    },
    {
      "chatId": -1003502632009,
      "messageId": 5271,
      "userId": 8045440327,
      "displayName": "✝️🙏PRAYER DOG🐺🥀 I am L.A.W.",
      "anonymous": false,
      "kind": "telegram",
      "text": "Guys, I got into a bike crash, my arms are jacked up, I am able to type this with slight pain, but I can't easy bend my arms without extreme pain, same with lifting, or even the pressure applied to when you hold the handlebars on the bike, and I have work tomorrow. Please pray for me, that I will heal, that this is just going to go away tomorrow, that somehow a miracle will occur so I can just miraculously heal, and if not, that I just heal quickly.",
      "ts": "2026-08-15T00:44:45Z"
    },
    {
      "chatId": -1003502632009,
      "messageId": 5277,
      "userId": 8045440327,
      "displayName": "✝️🙏PRAYER DOG🐺🥀 I am L.A.W.",
      "anonymous": false,
      "kind": "telegram",
      "text": "Hairline fracture on one arm, and sprained joint on the other. I am going to just focus on healing",
      "ts": "2026-08-15T19:50:35Z"
    },
    {
      "chatId": -1003502632009,
      "messageId": 5279,
      "userId": 5309134293,
      "displayName": "David",
      "anonymous": false,
      "kind": "telegram",
      "text": "Praying for you Liam, in Jesus' name",
      "ts": "2026-08-15T20:23:08Z"
    },
    {
      "chatId": -1003502632009,
      "messageId": 5302,
      "userId": 8045440327,
      "displayName": "✝️🙏PRAYER DOG🐺🥀 I am L.A.W.",
      "anonymous": false,
      "kind": "telegram",
      "text": "Super cool thing, but I had to go to base to get an Orthopedic referral, and so I called an Uber, and the guy who drove me, he was military contractor. (Think Military Uber) and that allowed him to enter base and drive me in front of the clinic to meet with my provider, his wife was a Christian missionary. And so we talked about it, and she is from Africa, and she's doing the good work and spreading Christ around.\n\nI am sharing this because I was initially worried I wouldn't be able to get an Orthopedic appointment before work, and so could hurt myself again, however, I had faith, I said God would take care of me. And then he provided, and he gave me the ability to not only get in further then I thought, and save time so I could make it to the last second appointment. But also so I could meet and pray over two faithful people who love Christ. God is working in my life, even with a busted arm.\n\nLike last night I went to Cavalry Lake Stevens YA, and bumped into the boyfriend I mentioned a week ago, his name is London, and we had a worship night there too. God is working in my life even now, and I want to share all this that you may have your own faith encouraged. That you can see or hear how God is working in my life, to know hes working in yours. \n\nGod bless, y'all. \n\nP.S. David, I'd love to get some of your pamphlets, I'd love to give them away if I could. Even with broken arm. 💪",
      "ts": "2026-08-17T18:25:18Z"
    },
    {
      "chatId": -1003502632009,
      "messageId": 5303,
      "userId": 5309134293,
      "displayName": "David",
      "anonymous": false,
      "kind": "telegram",
      "text": "Amen and absolutely will do! I'll meet up with you to give you more of these flyers. That's so amazing to hear!!!",
      "ts": "2026-08-17T18:34:21Z"
    },
    {
      "chatId": -1003502632009,
      "messageId": 5305,
      "userId": 5309134293,
      "displayName": "David",
      "anonymous": false,
      "kind": "telegram",
      "text": "Before our service starts tonight, I'm asking everyone who can, please lift up our team in prayer to Jesus so we can carry out our work today. Thank you brothers and sisters. God bless you🙏",
      "ts": "2026-08-18T00:12:25Z"
    }
